: true, "should_use_rag": true}, "reason": "查询企业知识库中关于 RAG 质量评测的指标"}, "build_plan": {"message_type": "business_question", "context_usage": "none", "intent": "rag_fact", "route": "rag", "standalone_query": "产品里的 RAG 质量评测通常看哪些指标？", "risk_level": "low", "knowledge_requirement": {"requires_company_knowledge": true, "known_from_user_message": false, "should_use_rag": true}, "execution_plan": {"tasks": [{"task_id": "t1", "kind": "rag", "objective": "查询产品中 RAG 质量评测通常使用的指标", "query": "产品里的 RAG 质量评测通常看哪些指标？"}], "strategy": "short"}, "reason": "查询企业知识库中关于 RAG 质量评测的指标"}, "answer_preview": "在产品中，RAG（Retrieval-Augmented Generation）质量评测通常会关注以下几类指标：\n\n- **命中率**：衡量检索系统能否准确找到相关文档或信息片段的能力。\n- **引用准确率**：评估生成的回答引用的证据是否正确无误。\n- **答案忠实度**：确保生成的回答忠实地反映了检索到的信息，没有扭曲原文的意思。\n- **拒答质量**：当输入的问题无法从知识库中获得足够信息来形成一个可靠回答时，系统应能够恰当地拒绝作答，并给出合适的反馈。\n- **多轮上下文保持**：对于涉及多个回合对话的情况，评价模型维持和理解上下文的能力。\n\n这些指标共同帮助评估RAG系统的性能及其在实际应用中的有效性。\n\nsource: product/product_02_rag_quality_eval_guidelines.docx, title_path: product_02_rag_quality_eval_guidelines.docx, chunk_id: b723248c1cb7:chunk:0346:9d0ef5e4\nsource: product/product_01_agent_platform_overview.md, title_path: 企业智能助手平台总览 > 6. 场景案例 > 案例 4：企业智能助手平台、模块边界和版本范围的边界判断, chunk_id: 63818fb1e478:chunk:0129:5e2fbee4", "failure_reasons": ["task_success", "refusal_accuracy", "actual_success=false"], "warnings": [], "error": null, "expected": {"task_success": true, "should_write": false, "should_refuse": false, "strict_answer_contains": false, "route": "rag", "expected_sources": ["product_01_enterprise_agentic_rag_product_spec.md", "product_02_rag_quality_eval_guidelines.docx"], "should_use_rag": true, "expected_answer_points": ["Recall", "Citation", "Faithfulness", "Latency"]}}
